@startuml
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
scale max 800 width
skinparam padding 2
skinparam ParticipantPadding 20
skinparam maxMessageSize 150

title 1.2 — Uniqueness Scoring: Compute & Confirm Flow

actor Operator as O
participant "Calibration\nView" as CV
participant "UniquenessScoringController" as USC
participant "AIInference\nGatewayService" as AI
participant "FastAPI\n(fastapi-sbert)" as FP
participant "Embedding\nStore" as ES

note over CV
  Prerequisite: Transaction 1.1 completed.
  Operator has confirmed category allocations
  (percentages > 0 for selected categories).
end note

== Compute Uniqueness Score ==

O -> CV: Adjust category sliders,\nclick "Compute Final Uniqueness Score"
CV -> USC: POST /api/classification/uniqueness\n{businessProfileId, businessName, categories,\ncoreServices, description, uvp}

USC -> AI: computeUniqueness(payload)
AI -> FP: POST /internal/classification/uniqueness

FP -> ES: fetch_others(excludeProfileId)
ES --> FP: List<vector(768)> corpus embeddings

FP -> FP: compute_semantic_uniqueness()\n[cosine distance vs corpus]\nif corpus < 3 → score = 100
FP -> FP: compute_category_score()\n[SBERT + Keras confidence\non selected categories]
FP -> FP: overallScore = mean(semantics, category)\n[50/50 average]

FP --> AI: {overallScore, semanticsScore, categoryScore,\ndescriptionFeedback, categoryFeedback}
AI --> USC: Map<String, Object>
USC --> CV: UniquenessResponse

CV -> CV: Render CalibrationResultsDashboard\n[OverallScoreCard + 2× ActionableScoreCard]

== Confirm & Register Profile ==

O -> CV: Review scores, click\n"Confirm & Register Profile"
CV -> CV: call api.saveProfile()\n[delegates to 1.1 PUT /api/business-profile\nwith uniquenessScore written to tbl_business_profile]
CV --> O: Navigate to Business Profile dashboard

@enduml
